      "text": "For US in-ovo penetration, I am using very low current base plus potentially fast rollout as the outside view. Innovate Animal Ag estimated the US was under 1% of the roughly 310M commercial layer flock at Q1 2025, while the EU had reached 28% by Q1 2025 (https://innovateanimalag.org/market-penetration-forecast and https://innovateanimalag.org/blog/2025-in-ovo-sexing-market-penetration-and-forecast-report). So my 2027 median stays in the low single digits, with upside if one or two large US integrations adopt quickly.",
